 "answer": "Out of the box, the Ollama server listens on the address `127.0.0.1` and port `11434`. The variable that changes the bind address is `OLLAMA_HOST`. You can set this environment variable to modify the default binding address for the Ollama server. \n\nFor example, if you want to change the server to listen on all network interfaces, you could set `OLLAMA_HOST` to `0.0.0.0:11434`. This is useful when you want to make the Ollama server accessible over the network. If you are working with IPv6, you might also set `OLLAMA_HOST` to `:11434` to enable IPv6 addressing, but ensure that Ollama version `0.0.20` or newer is being used for this feature.",
